{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2023-04-13 13:01:00', 'title': "DUKE ENERGY FLORIDA ADDS 150 MEGAWATTS OF CLEAN, RENEWABLE ENERGY TO THE GRID; COMPLETES TWO NEW SOLAR SITES AS PART OF COMPANY'S COMMUNITY SOLAR PROGRAM", 'text': "ST. PETERSBURG, FLA., APRIL 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUKE ENERGY TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF TWO SOLAR PROJECTS IN ALACHUA AND SUWANNEE COUNTIES, THE LATEST SITES IN THE COMPANY'S COMMUNITY SOLAR PROGRAM PORTFOLIO, CLEAN ENERGY CONNECTION. TOGETHER, THE SITES AT PEAK PRODUCTION ARE DELIVERING 150 MEGAWATTS OF CLEAN, RENEWABLE ENERGY TO THE GRID TO BENEFIT FLORIDA CUSTOMERS."}